  "details": "It would be really nice to be able to hotswap avatars by that I mean being able to have a cached avatar base and instead of reloading the entire avatar reloading only its clothes or actions while keeping the base model in-play.\nThis would allow players to have different clothes, animations, etc. Without having to worry about their avatars hitting Poor/Very Poor.\nIt would also reduce potential load times and download sizes for when people change into the same avatar base but with different clothes/toggles.\nI know this is a huge ask, but I can dream!",
